Common StudentEvaluationObjective
    documentation "The evaluation results for a student for the objective subcomponent or domain."
    domain entity ProgramEvaluationObjective
        documentation "The program evaluation objective associated with the student's results."
        is part of identity
        is required
    shared decimal EvaluationObjectiveRating
        documentation "The numerical rating or score for the evaluation objective."
        is optional
    descriptor EvaluationObjectiveRatingLevel
        documentation "The rating level achieved based upon the rating or score for the evaluation objective."
        is optional 